title: "THAAD-Style Terminal Intercept Simulation"
abstract: "A deterministic Python simulation of terminal ballistic missile defense: radar sensing, Kalman/EKF estimation, impact-point fire control, PN/APN/ZEM guidance, and hit-to-kill two-stage vehicle dynamics, with a live web workstation. Educational; uses only illustrative, unclassified parameters."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
